flowchart TD
    OFF[Official provider pages] --> REVIEW[Human review of requirements, dates and funding]
    OFF --> FETCH[Explicit Keenable fetch of approved HTTPS provider URLs]
    FETCH --> TEXT[Extracted source text: session or ignored runtime receipts]
    TEXT --> REVIEW
    REVIEW --> SEED[Developer-authored summaries, claims and rules: seed_catalog.py]
    SEED --> JSON[Reviewed opportunities.json with source URLs and review dates]
    JSON --> VALID[Pydantic validation]
    VALID --> UI[Reviewed opportunity cards and evidence links]
    FETCH --> SNAP[(Official snapshots: URL, timestamp and source ID)]
    SNAP --> EVID[Evidence judgments with exact quote validation]
    EVID --> FIT[Uncertainty passed to Fit and recommendation readiness]
    QUERY[Broad discipline search] --> SEARCH[Keenable search: at most five hits]
    SEARCH --> LEADS[Unverified web leads panel]
    LEADS -.-> MANUAL[Future manual review required before catalog inclusion]
    MANUAL -.-> REVIEW
    UI --> REFRESH[Student requests source refresh]
    REFRESH --> FETCH
